e_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-03-30T20:19:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T19:01:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118016","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118016.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118016.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Currently, most `MeshInstance3DEditor` tools (Create Navigation Mesh, Outline Mesh, Debug Tangents and Unwrap UV2) only process the first selected node even when there are multiple nodes selected. Additionally, nodes created by those tools are not automatically selected, requiring the user to manually find them in the scene tree to edit properties (such as Collision Layers for `StaticBody3D` nodes).\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for multi-selection in all of those tools, and ensures newly created nodes get selected after being created, keeping the behavior consistent across all tools mentioned.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118016/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118016/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}